      "writtenOn": "2023-02-03T13:45:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Regardless of whether we should keep a hardware slot reserved, we should absolutely use the callback to identify the request. That will work whether we reserve or not, and it will be a lot less sensitive to race conditions and much easier to read.\n\nThis should however be in another patch. Made aosp/2420340 below this.",
      "parentUuid": "951d7b1c_b71e5d41",
      "revId": "7978020d884a4f83b22e8ea3cd561c80b9d3290e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
