      "writtenOn": "2023-01-30T04:07:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could it be stopped because the binder died, but AutomaticOnOffKeepaliveTracker didn\u0027t know about it when it called this method ?\n\nIn general since KeepaliveInfo can be in BINDER_DIED stopped state without AutomaticOnOffKeepaliveTracker knowing about it, I think all methods in KeepaliveTracker need to support being called when it is stopped.\n\nI\u0027d say this really needs a refactor to only have the binder death in AutomaticOnOffKeepaliveTracker, although that\u0027s not exactly what this change is working on. Maybe file a bug for it ?",
      "revId": "7978020d884a4f83b22e8ea3cd561c80b9d3290e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
